[{"i":"1907261043868225537","no":1,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本题为多选题，请查看第二大题“实际操作”再进行本题作答。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 关于齿轮传动说法正确的2项是？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">能够精确地计算传动比</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">能够有缓冲作用保护机械</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">适合近距离传动</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">适合远距离传动</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p>分析齿轮传动的基本特性，包括传动比的计算方式、传动距离的适用范围、动力传递过程中是否存在弹性缓冲机制。明确齿轮啮合传动中速比由齿数决定，具有确定性；考察其在长距离与短距离应用中的结构实现方式；判断其是否具备通过自身材料或结构吸收冲击的能力。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"1907261157767303170","no":2,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以下说法正确的2项是？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">大齿轮带动小齿轮起加速作用</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">小齿轮带动大齿轮起加速作用</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">两轮啮合，半径大的齿轮齿数多</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">两轮平行啮合旋转方向相同</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"1907261275129946114","no":3,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">关于模型中的手摇把手说法正确的有哪些？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">手柄越长越省力</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">相当于省力杠杆</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">相当于费力杠杆</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">相当于等臂杠杆</span></p>"}],"a":"A,B","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["省力杠杆和费力杠杆","六种简单机械原理（杠杆，轮轴，滑轮，斜面，楔，螺旋）"]},{"i":"1907261418054668289","no":4,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下列关于传动比计算正确的2项是？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12齿齿轮带动6齿齿轮，传动比为1:2</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12齿齿轮带动6齿齿轮，传动比为2:1</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">主动轮与从动轮半径比为1:3，传动比为3:1</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">主动轮与从动轮半径比为1:3，传动比为1:3</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"1907261961431326722","no":5,"t":4,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">实际操作(共1题，共80分)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">搭建说明：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请考生制作一个手动搅拌器模型。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">搭建要求：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（a）具备手动搅拌器模型大体框架；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（b）具备垂直啮合的齿轮和平行啮合的齿轮，且能实现加速；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（c）具备手摇把手和表示搅拌部分的零件；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（d）缓慢旋转手摇把手，搅拌部分加速旋转；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（e）整体动作流畅。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">评分项：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1.整体框架（40分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（1）作品零件结构和样例模型基本一致，结构完整；（20分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（2）作品相应部件固定可靠；（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（3）作品整体协调美观。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.动力传递/表现形式（30分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（1）完整实现题目要求的动作；（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（2）作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.完成时间（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">器材说明：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">考生作答时不指定任何器材，所搭建的模型在外形、结构、功能方面满足题目要求即可。以下样例模型选自经中国电子学会评审通过的青少年机器人技术等级考试一级、二级适用器材。仅供参考，不作为考试评分的唯一依据。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">案例样图：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以下列举了相关器材模型样例，考生可任选其一作为参考。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例1</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-04-02-10-39-34/8595602611674267648.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例2</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-04-02-10-39-48/8595602670121869312.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例3</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-04-02-10-39-58/8595602713977511936.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例4</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-04-02-10-40-08/8595602753701765120.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例5</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-04-02-10-40-27/8595602832999276544.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例6</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-04-02-10-40-38/8595602878411030528.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p>","o":[],"a":"","an":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">评分说明</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 整体框架（40分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（1）作品零件结构和样例模型基本一致，结构完整；（20分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（2）作品相应部件固定可靠；（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（3）作品整体协调美观。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2. 动力传递/表现形式（30分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（1）完整实现题目要求的动作；（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（2）作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3. 完成时间（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在考试时间内完成得10分，超时1分钟扣1分。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">超时10分钟以上不结束操作总成绩记为0分。</span></p>","sc":80.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念","动滑轮、定滑轮的特点","六种简单机械原理（杠杆，轮轴，滑轮，斜面，楔，螺旋）"]}]